- **"Contribution"** means any code, documentation, or other material You submit back to this project (e.g. via pull request).
- **"Fork"** means a copy of the Software, modified or not, maintained separately from the original project.
- **"Restricted Asset"** means any file, dataset, or material named as such above (here: the KOI Hearts dataset). Restricted Assets are governed by Section 5, not the general grant in Section 2.
- **"Exempt Output"** means any output produced by running or training on the Software that is named above as exempt from the share-alike/attribution rules in Section 3. This project currently has none — see manifest above.

